dashboard.indices_ajuda_msg:
The system separates COST from PROFIT.

Ideal revenue per hour: R$ {{metaPorHora}}

Example for a {{exKm}}km and {{exMin}}min trip:

COST (break-even):
- {{exKm}}km x R$ {{custoPorKm}} = R$ {{calcKmCusto}}
- {{exMin}}min x R$ {{custoPorMinuto}} = R$ {{calcMinCusto}}
Real cost: R$ {{custoTotal}}

GOAL (money in your pocket):
- Driving cost (R$ {{calcKmCusto}})
- + Time & profit ({{exMin}}min x R$ {{metaPorMinuto}} = R$ {{calcMinMeta}})
Ideal revenue: R$ {{metaTotal}}

Summary: if it pays less than R$ {{custoTotal}}, you pay to work. Focus on your goal/hour.
